  "plain": "The retired senior intelligence official Bobby Ray Inman says he is confident that nothing else is alive anywhere in our galaxy. In an interview played on the show in the 2020s, he says: \"I have a high level of confidence that within our galaxy there is no other living life.\" If he is right, the stories of visitors from nearby stars would have no one to be about."
